---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Ship Gate fixture site" description="A tiny site that proves every Ship Gate check runs end to end on a conforming build.">
  <h1>Ship Gate fixture site</h1>
  <h2>What this is</h2>
  <p>Every pull request to Ship Gate runs the whole gate against this site. It is small on purpose: three
    pages, a form, a sitemap, a robots.txt and structured data, each one written to pass every check, so a
    broken copy that fails proves the check that owns the fault still works.</p>
</Base>
